# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in your keys. Loaded automatically when you
# run a command from the project root. A real exported env var always takes
# precedence over a value here. Everything after the first `=` is the value —
# an inline `#` is NOT treated as a comment.
#
# Codex (default image provider) normally does NOT use this file — it reads the OAuth
# token from ~/.codex/auth.json (run `codex login`). The one exception is an account
# POOL (below), which replaces auth.json entirely.

# --- Codex account pool (optional) -------------------------------------------
# Point Codex at a proxy that fronts many ChatGPT accounts behind ONE bearer key
# (CLIProxyAPI and friends), instead of your own `codex login`. The proxy must speak
# the Responses wire format; the base URL may be the host root, `.../v1`, or the full
# `.../v1/responses`. SET BOTH OR NEITHER — a half-configured pair is refused rather
# than silently falling back to your personal account's quota.
# Leave blank to use your own ChatGPT login.
CODEX_IMAGEGEN_BASE_URL=
CODEX_IMAGEGEN_API_KEY=

# MiniMax vision (M3) — token-metered, so your MiniMax token plan covers it.
# Used by `imagegen-merge --vision minimax`.
MINIMAX_API_KEY=

# MiniMax image generation (Image-01) — per-image, pay-as-you-go (separate balance,
# NOT covered by the token plan). Used by `imagegen --provider minimax`.
MINIMAX_IMAGE_API_KEY=
